concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-5a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5A Power of Minister to give directions"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-5a ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by writing, give directions to the CEO with respect to the performance of the CEO’s functions under this Act (including in relation to the appropriate strategic direction the CEO should take in performing his or her functions). Note: A direction under this section is included in the annual report: see section 39.  (2) A direction given under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The Minister may, by writing, give directions to the CEO with respect to the performance of the CEO’s functions under this Act (including in relation to the appropriate strategic direction the CEO should take in performing his or her functions). Note: A direction under this section is included in the annual report: see section 39.  (2) A direction given under subsection (1) is not a legislative instrument."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "cd8b8a9d573516bb0f0fc8404e068d195908a5f931dbf38eb5c9cdba48a67230" ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
