concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-19a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19A Remuneration and allowances"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-19a ;
    values:originalText "(1) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If  Schedule 1  Amendments  12            Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Amendment Act 2007       No. 115, 2007 no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.  (2) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the regulations.  (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If  Schedule 1  Amendments  12            Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Amendment Act 2007       No. 115, 2007 no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in operation, the appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations.  (2) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the regulations.  (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "060208f53addd92d8e52f2cd743de70380df4f75599d115d1ef8a0e6a2118db1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "15"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-19a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-19a-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-1-sec-19a-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf> ;
    dc:source "australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf, p.15" .
