concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 Certificates relating to vesting of assets other than land"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This item applies if:  (a) any asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under this Part; and  (b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:  (i) is signed by the Minister; and  (ii) identifies the asset; and  (iii) states that the asset has become vested in the Commonwealth under this Part. Note: Certificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17. (2) The assets official may:  (a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a proper and appropriate instrument for transactions in relation to assets of that kind; and  (b) make such entries in the register as are necessary, having regard to the effect of this Schedule." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This item applies if:  (a) any asset other than land vests in the Commonwealth under this Part; and  (b) there is lodged with an assets official a certificate that:  (i) is signed by the Minister; and  (ii) identifies the asset; and  (iii) states that the asset has become vested in the Commonwealth under this Part. Note: Certificates under paragraph (1)(b) are presumed to be authentic: see item 17. (2) The assets official may:  (a) deal with, and give effect to, the certificate as if it were a proper and appropriate instrument for transactions in relation to assets of that kind; and  (b) make such entries in the register as are necessary, having regard to the effect of this Schedule."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "295333e681ec5fa9b258c4b6eb544a8fc61d3872066364bbb864e95e2c776f09" ;
    cof:pageNumber "25"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Assets must be lodged with an assets official for vesting to occur." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf> ;
