concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-11 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "11 CEO"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-11 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The person holding office as the Director under section 24 of the old law immediately before the commencement time is taken, at the commencement time, to have been duly appointed as the CEO by the Governor-General under section 24 of the new law:  (a) for the balance of the person’s term of appointment that remained immediately before the commencement time; and  (b) on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person immediately before the commencement time. (2) This item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after the commencement time." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The person holding office as the Director under section 24 of the old law immediately before the commencement time is taken, at the commencement time, to have been duly appointed as the CEO by the Governor-General under section 24 of the new law:  (a) for the balance of the person’s term of appointment that remained immediately before the commencement time; and  (b) on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person immediately before the commencement time. (2) This item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after the commencement time."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b3639503fb6eba60218fe40bdd14d77e3929c6a1dcdf7c8c46158c79fd7934dc" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "The person holding office as the Director is taken to have been duly appointed as CEO." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007.pdf> ;
