concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-12 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12 Staff of the Centre"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-12 ;
    values:originalText "(1) A person who was a member of the staff of the Centre immediately before the commencement time is taken, at the commencement time, to have been engaged by the CEO as a member of the staff of the Centre. (2) The person is taken to have been engaged on the same terms and conditions as applied to the person immediately before the commencement time. (3) This item does not prevent those terms and conditions being varied after the commencement time." ;
