concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-amendment-act-2007-sch-2-sec-15 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15 Exemption from stamp duty and other State or Territory"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-15 ;
    values:originalText "taxes No stamp duty or other tax is payable under a law of a State or Territory in respect of, or in respect of anything connected with:  (a) the transfer of an asset or liability under this Schedule; or  (b) the operation of this Schedule in any other respect." ;
    skos:definition "taxes No stamp duty or other tax is payable under a law of a State or Territory in respect of, or in respect of anything connected with:  (a) the transfer of an asset or liability under this Schedule; or  (b) the operation of this Schedule in any other respect."@en ;
